 Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","review_id":"mk6C9qYkOgFsZp9KGWPfSA","date":"2010-08-17T16:51:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9562413692474365,"text_excerpt":"Last night, my boyfriend was inspired to throw together an impromptu date night and kicked the evening off by taking me here for dinner. Wow, what a true New Orleans experience! Gautreau's is a hidden gem in the uptown neighborhood just off of Jefferson Ave (literally hidden -- there is no sign outside of the restaurant, and the building looks like someone's very nice, expensive home). I had never heard of Gautreau's before, and there is good reason for that; it seems like the locals/regulars like to keep this dining experience a secret to preserve the understated yet refined neighborhood feel. Gautreau's is a neighborhood restaurant with a menu similar to that of Upperline, Dante's Kitch..."},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","review_id":"b0Y3k6O0JyV9ObUzxmyPhg","date":"2015-12-10T23:41:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378469586372375,"text_excerpt":"My first time at Gautreau's, and I am really impressed. Ambiance, service and food were superior. I enjoyed a fabulous pinot noir (2013 Ken Wright, Oregon), sweetbreads (unbelievable), pork short ribs (unbelievable), bib lettuce and endive salad. Others in my party enjoyed the quail and the red snapper special. All were just plain fabulous. It is no wonder that my neighbors consider this place their \"go to\" local restaurant for fine food."},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","review_id":"6Wr7qW36ECCpNCyWZEPf2Q","date":"2013-06-21T13:11:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9375966787338257,"text_excerpt":"This is perfect example of why reviewing a restaurant based on one visit is not a good idea. I dined here about 2 years ago and was anticipating an awesome meal based on the reviews by critics I respected including those who work for a little outfit called the James Beard Awards. And, unfortunately, I was underwhelemed by my meal. I returned a few days ago and had one of the best meals in recent memory. For an appetizer I had the seared sea scallops with crawfish tails with artichokes, fingerling potatoes, corn and andouille. As some may know, I'm a big scallop fan, so I'm always interested in different preparations of them. This one came, I believe, with a foie gras based sauce. Weird, b..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","photo_id":"PplNgZBi63hZiHLXUSrKBg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PplNgZBi63hZiHLXUSrKBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8947404026985168},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","photo_id":"0dakJklR2FJNGdLHAz335w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0dakJklR2FJNGdLHAz335w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8852027654647827},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","photo_id":"0PGZdgnz8xdW5DNZlvQSwg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0PGZdgnz8xdW5DNZlvQSwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8655226230621338},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","photo_id":"bwEWNyiL8mUimsaPc_x1gQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bwEWNyiL8mUimsaPc_x1gQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8594938516616821},{"business_id":"dju1isgEvDd74tLTDkk5DA","photo_id":"rt5ZIoXAvZjGOXF7dixc5w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rt5ZIoXAvZjGOXF7dixc5w.jpg","visual_